                        "email": "patrick@stwcx.xyz",
                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "I know this was already existing but we probably should have the plug and unplug be opposite:\n\n* plug = present + power-on\n* unplug = power-off + not present\n\nThis might also help with figuring out the appropriate place for the obmc_console actions (my next comment)."
                },
